<title>SWITZERLAND: Bank Leu boosts 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Bank Leu boosts 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p> (million Swiss francs)		  1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net profit				  72.8  vs   56.1</p>
<p> Paid-out dividends			74.0  vs   48.0</p>
<p> Total assets			    14,862  vs 12,985</p>
<p> Employees				  1,074  vs  1,292</p>
<p> Return on equity (pct)		    11  vs	8</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank Leu is part of Credit Suisse Group's private banking division</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
